    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/456140/extras/319aa14e4c00b4f449dc3a567961a3f8.poster.avif?t=1747690597\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/456140/extras/319aa14e4c00b4f449dc3a567961a3f8.webm?t=1747690597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/456140/extras/319aa14e4c00b4f449dc3a567961a3f8.mp4?t=1747690597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the shoes of Bobo, a lovable and clumsy jester whose biggest mishap unleashes a wave of darkness over the kingdom! During a lively performance, Bobo accidentally opens a forgotten magical chest, releasing shadowy creatures that steal all the fun and laughter from the land turning every kind of objects into monsters!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaa Now, it\u2019s up to Bobo to embark on a whimsical adventure across vibrant and diverse realms. Jump, bounce, and dash through charming landscapes filled with tricky platforming challenges, secret paths, and quirky puzzles. Armed with a quirky arsenal of comedic gadgets and creative tools, Bobo must outwit these gloom-spreading spirits and restore joy to the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>If you love classic platformers with  imaginative worlds bursting with color, and a hero who proves that laughter really is the best weapon, <i>Bobo and the Chest of Nightmares</i> is your next must-play!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delightful 3D platforming action with smooth controls and clever level design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore unique, playful environments full of secrets and surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use inventive, comedy-inspired gadgets to solve puzzles and defeat foes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A heartwarming story about fun, friendship, and the power of laughter</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready to jump into a world where fun is your superpower!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/456140/extras/319aa14e4c00b4f449dc3a567961a3f8.poster.avif?t=1747690597\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/456140/extras/319aa14e4c00b4f449dc3a567961a3f8.webm?t=1747690597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/456140/extras/319aa14e4c00b4f449dc3a567961a3f8.mp4?t=1747690597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the shoes of Bobo, a lovable and clumsy jester whose biggest mishap unleashes a wave of darkness over the kingdom! During a lively performance, Bobo accidentally opens a forgotten magical chest, releasing shadowy creatures that steal all the fun and laughter from the land turning every kind of objects into monsters!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaa Now, it\u2019s up to Bobo to embark on a whimsical adventure across vibrant and diverse realms. Jump, bounce, and dash through charming landscapes filled with tricky platforming challenges, secret paths, and quirky puzzles. Armed with a quirky arsenal of comedic gadgets and creative tools, Bobo must outwit these gloom-spreading spirits and restore joy to the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>If you love classic platformers with  imaginative worlds bursting with color, and a hero who proves that laughter really is the best weapon, <i>Bobo and the Chest of Nightmares</i> is your next must-play!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delightful 3D platforming action with smooth controls and clever level design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore unique, playful environments full of secrets and surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use inventive, comedy-inspired gadgets to solve puzzles and defeat foes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A heartwarming story about fun, friendship, and the power of laughter</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready to jump into a world where fun is your superpower!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    </p>",
    "short_description": "Jump, glide, and outsmart traps in this whimsical 3D platformer! Smash, fend off mischievous spirits, grind rails, and solve puzzles as you uncover the secrets of the Nightmare Chest. Collect hidden treasures and restore joy to a world shrouded in darkness!",
